<phyphox version="1.14"><title>Camera, IMU and GNSS logger</title><category>Raw Sensors</category><description>Video of the back camera together with the accelerometer, gyroscope, magnetometer, pressure and satellite navigation (fixes, satellites, NMEA and raw measurements), all on one clock, for visual odometry.

The video is recorded at 1920x1080 and 30 frames per second with the focus fixed at infinity and stabilization off, in MP4 files of about a minute each. The presentation time of every frame is its experiment time, the time column of the other tables. The table "Video frames" has a row per frame: time of the start of its exposure, exposure, rolling-shutter skew, frame duration, ISO, focus distance and frame number. The CSV export contains the video files in media/ and the camera's intrinsics, distortion and pose in meta/camera.csv, with the intrinsics also converted to the pixels of the video.

The video stops when the screen of the experiment is left. These inputs exist only in this build of phyphox.</description><data-containers><container size="0">acc_time</container><container size="0">accX</container><container size="0">accY</container><container size="0">accZ</container><container size="0">gyr_time</container><container size="0">gyrX</container><container size="0">gyrY</container><container size="0">gyrZ</container><container size="0">mag_time</container><container size="0">magX</container><container size="0">magY</container><container size="0">magZ</container><container size="0">pressure_time</container><container size="0">pressure</container><container size="0">loc_time</container><container size="0">locLat</container><container size="0">locLon</container><container size="0">locZ</container><container size="0">locV</container><container size="0">locDir</container><container size="0">locAccuracy</container><container size="0">locZAccuracy</container><container size="0">locStatus</container><container size="0">locSatellites</container><container size="0">utc</container><container size="0">satellitesInView</container><container size="0">satellitesUsed</container><container size="0">signalsInView</container><container size="0">signalsUsed</container><container size="0">cn0Mean</container><container size="0">cn0Max</container><container size="0">cn0Min</container><container size="0">meanCn0</container><container size="0">maxCn0</container><container size="0">vAccuracy</container><container size="0">dirAccuracy</container><container size="0">zMsl</container><container size="0">zMslAccuracy</container><container size="0">tUncertainty</container><container size="0">mock</container><container size="0">svT</container><container size="0">svId</container><container size="0">svConstellation</container><container size="0">svCn0</container><container size="0">svUsed</container><container size="0">svElevation</container><container size="0">svAzimuth</container><co